  "description": "Lee Hyeon-U's had a parade of terrible ex-boyfriends, with his most recent ex dumping him in favor of a marriage to advance his career. Tired of his wretched love life and in need of some space, Hyeon-U moves out of the city to the countryside. He's only planning to stay there for a while until he's recovered from his broken heart, but then he meets stoic farmer boy Kim Do-Won. Hyeon-U doesn’t mean to get mixed up with Do-Won, especially when he knows it won’t last, but things rarely ever go his way... \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: The chapter count includes a 7-chapter side story and a 2-chapter epilogue.*",
